ssmeld", map = 1418, x = 2.4, y = 46.1, zone = "Badlands" }, here = true }, { id = 2340, title = "Deliver the Gems", level = 44, min = 37, side = "Horde", type = "Dungeon", obj = "Deliver the Necklace and Gem Salvage to Dran Droffers in Orgrimmar.", start = { kind = "npc", name = "Jarkal Mossmeld", map = 1418, x = 2.4, y = 46.1, zone = "Badlands" }, here = true }, { id = 2341, title = "Necklace Recovery, Take 3", level = 44, min = 40, side = "Horde", type = "Dungeon", obj = "Visit Jarkal Mossmeld in Kargath to see if he was successful.", start = { kind = "npc", name = "Dran Droffers", map = 1454, x = 59.6, y = 36.5, zone = "Orgrimmar" }, rewards = { 7888 }, here = true } } },
